From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcp: Implement the remaining C threads functions.

The C threads layer of msvcp had spec stubs: _Mtxinit, _Mtxdst, _Mtxlock
and _Mtxunlock (the library's recursive critical section mutex, msvcp100
and later), _Mtx_timedlock (waits for the mutex until the given time, 2 on
time out), _Thrd_exit and _Thrd_abort (msvcp110 and later), _Tss_create,
_Tss_delete, _Tss_get and _Tss_set (thread specific storage whose
destructors run at thread exit and not after _Tss_delete; msvcp110,
msvcp120) and _Once (msvcp100 .. msvcp120). msvcp120_app and msvcp_win
forward.
